VALUES ($aq$ocr-strings-36$aq$, 'gcse', $aq$ocr$aq$, $aq$strings$aq$, $aq$string-build-trace$aq$, 5, 3, $aq$text$aq$, $aq$```
text = "data"
result = ""
for i = 0 to text.length - 1
    result = text.substring(i, 1) + result
next i
print(result)
```

(a) State the value of `result` after the first time round the loop. [1]

(b) State the value of `result` after the second time round the loop. [1]

