VALUES ($aq$aqa-functions-45$aq$, 'gcse', $aq$aqa$aq$, $aq$functions$aq$, $aq$function-complex-trace$aq$, 5, 3, $aq$text$aq$, $aq$The following algorithm is written in pseudo-code.

```
SUBROUTINE calc(a, b)
  c ← a + b
  RETURN c * a
ENDSUBROUTINE

x ← calc(2, 3)
y ← calc(x, 1)
OUTPUT x
OUTPUT y
```

(a) State the value of `c` the first time the subroutine runs. [1]

(b) State the value stored in `x`. [1]

(c) State the value returned by `calc(x, 1)`. [1]

(d) State the output of the algorithm. [1]

(e) State the number of parameters the subroutine has. [1]$aq$)
