VALUES ($aq$aqa-selection-45$aq$, 'gcse', $aq$aqa$aq$, $aq$selection$aq$, $aq$complex-trace$aq$, 5, 3, $aq$text$aq$, $aq$The following algorithm is written in pseudo-code.

```
n ← STRING_TO_INT(USERINPUT)
IF n MOD 2 = 0 THEN
  IF n > 50 THEN
    OUTPUT "Large even"
  ELSE
    OUTPUT "Small even"
  ENDIF
ELSE IF n > 50 THEN
  OUTPUT "Large odd"
ELSE
  OUTPUT "Small odd"
ENDIF
```

