INSERT INTO public.assessment_questions (id, track, board, topic, concept, marks, ability, answer_format, question)
VALUES ($aq$aqa-strings-36$aq$, 'gcse', $aq$aqa$aq$, $aq$strings$aq$, $aq$string-build-trace$aq$, 5, 3, $aq$text$aq$, $aq$The following algorithm is written in pseudo-code. The first character of a string is at position 0.

```
text ← "tree"
result ← ""
FOR i ← 0 TO LEN(text) - 1
  result ← SUBSTRING(i, i, text) + result
ENDFOR
OUTPUT result
```

(a) State the value of `result` after the first time round the loop. [1]

(b) State the value of `result` after the second time round the loop. [1]

(c) State the output of the algorithm. [1]

(d) State the number of times the loop runs. [1]

(e) Describe what the algorithm does. [1]$aq$)
